<title>FRANCE: Cetelem 9-mth sales to Sept 30 up 16 pct.</title>
<headline>Cetelem 9-mth sales to Sept 30 up 16 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					35,900    vs   30,800</p>
<p>Of which:</p>
<p>     France					 34,100    vs   29,700</p>
<p>     Other European countries		  1,800    vs    1,100</p>
<p>NOTE - French consumer credit house Cetelem said in a statement that growth in October and November was slightly weaker than in the first nine months, although satisfying overall. Growth rates in December should be higher, however, because of the effect of strikes in France in December 1995, it said.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
